/* ── Freshness degrade (pt_cadaa70ffa6b468d) ──
   The authoritative channel is not delivering, so a busy indicator may be
   showing a state that has since changed. Deliberately a SOFTENING (hollow +
   dimmed + slow pulse), never a different colour: the conversation really may
   still be busy, so this must read as "uncertain", not as a new status.
   Applied ON TOP of the existing dot class, so both the layout and the
   DOM-reconcile selector in conversation_list.js stay unchanged. */
.conv-streaming-dot.conv-state-unconfirmed{opacity:.45;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;border:1.5px solid #10b981;animation:convUnconfirmedPulse 2s ease-in-out infinite}
.conv-status-tag.conv-state-unconfirmed{opacity:.6;font-style:italic}
@keyframes convUnconfirmedPulse{0%,100%{opacity:.4}50%{opacity:.85}}
