/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════
   ★ Tofu swarm PANEL — un-box the dashboard inside its round card
   Root cause of the "white frame around a beige slab": the ptool redesign
   (2026-07-08) made each round ONE #FFFDF9 card, but the swarm dashboard
   still drew itself as a SECOND, darker filled card inside it (bg-secondary
   + border + shadow, inset by margin) — boxes-in-boxes. Tofu now treats
   .sw-panel as chrome-less content of its .ptool-turn: the round card is
   the only frame; status reads from title/pill/progress accents in the
   wagashi palette (kinako active / matcha complete / azuki failed), and
   the dark-theme neon + white-alpha fills (invisible on cream) become
   warm ink steps. Dark/light themes are untouched.
   ═══════════════════════════════════════════ */
