/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   ★★★ MOBILE RESPONSIVE DESIGN ★★★
   Complete phone-friendly experience
   ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

/* ── Sidebar Backdrop (mobile overlay) ── */
.sidebar-backdrop{display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;height:var(--vh100,100vh);background:rgba(0,0,0,0.35);z-index:25;opacity:0;transition:opacity .3s ease;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
.sidebar-backdrop.visible{display:block;opacity:1}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   PORTRAIT-TABLET / FOLDABLE CHAT DRAWER  (769px–1024px, coarse pointer)
   ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   At this viewport paper-reading mode ALREADY single-panes
   (`@media(max-width:768px),(max-width:1024px) and (pointer:coarse)`), but the
   CHAT sidebar stayed a pinned 280px flex child — an internal inconsistency
   across our own surfaces at one screen size. This block turns the chat sidebar
   into the SAME slide-over drawer the phone uses, WITHOUT the ≤768px 360px
   compaction (topbar badge-hiding, message avatar removal, font shrink) which a
   ~900px tablet does not need. The `pointer:coarse` half keeps a fine-pointer
   desktop narrowed to <1024px, and any landscape tablet >1024px, on the pinned
   two-pane layout. The lower bound (min-width:769px) hands ≤768 to the phone
   master block so the two never both apply.

   KEEP IN SYNC with core.js isTabletDrawerViewport() / TOFU_BP.tablet=1024 and
   the paper-mode predicate above (guarded by
   tests/test_breakpoint_coordination.py). */
@media(min-width:769px) and (max-width:1024px) and (pointer:coarse){
  /* Sidebar → fixed slide-over drawer (mirrors the phone drawer geometry, a
   * touch wider since a tablet has the room). */
  .sidebar{position:fixed!important;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:min(360px,80vw);max-width:360px;min-width:auto!important;z-index:30;padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);transform:translateX(-100%);transition:transform .3s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1);box-shadow:none;will-change:transform}
  /* The derived desktop has-rail width (rail + list-min) must NOT widen the
   * fixed drawer — reset it; the icon-only rail lives INSIDE the drawer. Also
   * neutralize the pre-paint html[data-rail] hint (JS hasn't added .has-rail
   * yet on first paint, so match the hint too or the drawer paints too wide). */
  .sidebar.has-rail,.sidebar.has-rail.rail-collapsed,
  html[data-rail] .sidebar{width:min(360px,80vw)!important;min-width:auto!important}
  .sidebar.collapsed{margin-left:0;transform:translateX(-100%)}
  .sidebar.has-rail.collapsed,.sidebar.has-rail.rail-collapsed.collapsed{margin-left:0!important}
  .sidebar:not(.collapsed){transform:translateX(0);box-shadow:4px 0 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.25)}
  /* Tofu theme sets overflow:visible / position:relative on these for desktop
   * dropdown popovers; re-assert containment at matching (0,2,0) specificity so
   * the drawer clips correctly (same war the phone block fights). */
  [data-theme="tofu"] .sidebar{position:fixed!important;overflow:hidden!important}
  [data-theme="tofu"] .sidebar.collapsed{transform:translateX(-100%)!important}
  [data-theme="tofu"] .sidebar:not(.collapsed){transform:translateX(0)!important}
  /* Main pane takes the full width — it is no longer pushed by the (now fixed)
   * sidebar. */
  .main{width:100%!important;flex:1!important;min-width:0!important}
  /* ★ ROOT-CAUSE FIX (portrait-tablet blank screen): the desktop tofu rule
   * `[data-theme="tofu"] .chat-wrapper{overflow:visible}` (a dropdown-escape
   * hatch, ~L13315) leaks into this drawer layout. With overflow:visible the
   * wrapper (a `flex:1;min-height:0` item) no longer establishes a definite
   * height context, so its child `.chat-container` (also `flex:1;min-height:0`)
   * collapses to height:0 and the whole chat pane paints blank — even though
   * `.chat-inner` has content. Re-assert containment at matching (0,2,0)
   * specificity, exactly as the ≤768 phone block does. The toolbar-dropdown
   * escape need is a desktop-hover concern; the drawer layout doesn't rely on it. */
  [data-theme="tofu"] .chat-wrapper{overflow:hidden!important}
  /* Sidebar-header action buttons get 44px touch targets (beats the tofu
   * 0,3,0 selector — same insurance the phone block uses). */
  .sidebar-header-actions .action-btn,
  [data-theme="tofu"] .sidebar-header .action-btn{width:44px!important;height:44px!important}
  /* Comfortable touch rows for the conversation list. */
  .conv-item{min-height:48px}

  /* The width-only desktop-compaction breakpoints (≤1080/≤1024) are gated on
   * `pointer:fine`, so they never strip labels here — no re-show needed. What we
   * DO need is graceful clipping for the topbar model badge: its base rule has
   * `white-space:nowrap` but NO max-width/ellipsis (that only exists in the ≤768
   * phone block), so a long model name at 769px would be hard-cut by the
   * topbar's `overflow:hidden` with no ellipsis. Cap + ellipsis it, matching the
   * phone treatment but roomier. */
  .model-badge{max-width:200px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}

  /* ===== TOUCH-ENABLE MESSAGE ACTIONS =====
   * The base `.message-actions` is a hover-reveal (opacity:0 → 1 on
   * `.message:hover`), which a coarse-pointer tablet can NEVER trigger — so
   * copy / edit / regenerate / delete are invisible and unreachable here. The
   * ≤768 phone block fixes this by re-flowing them inline; a tablet keeps the
   * roomier desktop message layout (avatar column intact), so we instead just
   * make them permanently visible in their absolute top-right slot (same place
   * they appear on desktop hover) and give each control a comfortable touch
   * target. `.message:hover` still applies on a hybrid device with a mouse. */
  .message-actions{opacity:1}
  .msg-action-btn{padding:6px 10px;font-size:11px;min-height:36px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center}
  /* Tofu sets `.msg-action-btn{padding:3px 6px;font-size:10px}` at (0,2,0),
   * beating the plain rule above — re-assert the touch padding/font to match
   * (same war the phone block fights). */
  [data-theme="tofu"] .msg-action-btn{padding:6px 10px;font-size:11px}

  /* ===== INPUT AREA touch sizing =====
   * The desktop toolbar fits at this width (no ···-sheet compaction like the
   * phone), so we keep the full toolbar but grow the send button + textarea
   * font to comfortable touch/no-iOS-zoom sizes. */
  .send-btn{width:40px;height:40px;padding:0}
  textarea{font-size:16px}

  /* ===== CHAT READING MEASURE =====
   * The sidebar is now a slide-over drawer, so the chat pane spans the FULL
   * viewport width (up to 1024px). The base `.chat-inner{max-width:820px}` then
   * sits centered with ~102px of dead gutter each side at a 1024px portrait
   * tablet (e.g. iPad Pro 12.9") — the pane no longer "breathes". Widen the
   * reading measure to 920px for the band: it fills the tablet pane far better
   * (~52px gutters at 1024px, edge-to-edge below ~968px) while staying a
   * comfortable line length (content ~872px after the 24px inner padding, still
   * under the ~90ch upper bound). Phones (≤768) keep the base cap via their own
   * `max-width:100%` overflow rule. */
  .chat-inner{max-width:920px}

  /* ===== MODEL-PICKER DROPDOWN must ESCAPE the clipped chat-wrapper =====
   * This block clips `.chat-wrapper{overflow:hidden}` (blank-screen fix above).
   * The desktop `.preset-dropdown` opens UPWARD (position:absolute;
   * bottom:calc(100%+6px)) INSIDE that now-clipped wrapper, so tapping the
   * model toggle rendered a dropdown that was clipped away → "nothing happens".
   * Make it a position:fixed bottom-sheet (like the phone block) so it escapes
   * ANY ancestor overflow. Sized off the --vh100 guard var, not bare dvh (which
   * collapses to 0 in the WebView — same class as the 11-overlay fix). */
  .preset-dropdown{position:fixed;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;top:auto;transform:none;
    min-width:auto;width:100%;border-radius:16px 16px 0 0;
    padding:8px 8px calc(8px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px));
    max-height:60vh;max-height:calc(var(--vh100,100vh) * 0.6);overflow-y:auto;z-index:200}
  .preset-toggle-wrapper.open .preset-dropdown{transform:none}
  .preset-dropdown-item{padding:12px 14px;border-radius:10px;font-size:13px;min-height:48px}
  .ps-dd-search{margin:-8px -8px 8px;top:-8px}

  /* ===== COMPACT TOOLBAR (same as phone) — else the model picker vanishes =====
   * This block keeps the FULL desktop toolbar (it does NOT inherit the ≤768
   * compaction). At ~837px, submenus (增强/工具/模式) + action buttons + search +
   * send fill the nowrap row, and the model picker — fully shrinkable
   * (.input-actions-scroll flex:0 1 auto → #modelGroup flex-shrink:1 →
   * .preset-toggle-wrapper flex:0 1 auto, all min-width:0, .preset-toggle
   * overflow:hidden) — collapses to an invisible sliver (NOT display:none, so a
   * grep for hidden misses it). Root-cause fix: apply the phone's compaction —
   * move the submenus + standalone actions into the "···" bottom sheet and free
   * the row width, so the model picker keeps its natural size. */
  #submenuExtras,#submenuFlow,#submenuMode,
  #imageGenBtn,#projectBtn{display:none!important}
  .mobile-more-btn{display:flex!important;width:40px;height:40px;align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;border:1.5px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:12px;background:var(--bg-tertiary);color:var(--text-secondary);
    cursor:pointer;box-sizing:border-box}
  /* Model picker must NOT shrink below a readable width now that the row has
   * room — pin a floor so it can never collapse to a sliver again. */
  #modelGroup{flex-shrink:0}
  .preset-toggle{flex-shrink:0;min-width:96px;max-width:200px}
}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   WIDE COARSE-POINTER TABLET  (≥1025px, pointer:coarse)
   ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   A ≥1025px touch device (e.g. a 1280px Android tablet in the WebView) is
   ABOVE the tablet-drawer band (≤1024 coarse) and TOFU_BP.tablet=1024, so the
   app treats it as DESKTOP: pinned sidebar + FULL composer toolbar. But in
   project mode the sidebar carries the project rail (--project-rail-w 150 +
   --sidebar-list-min 280 = 430px), leaving the chat pane ~850px at 1280 — too
   tight for the nowrap toolbar (attach + model + 3 submenus + search + send).
   The model picker is the ONLY shrinkable child (.input-actions-scroll
   flex:0 1 auto → #modelGroup flex-shrink:1), so it collapses to an invisible
   sliver — the SAME "model preset vanished" bug the ≤1024-coarse and ≤768
   blocks already fix, just at a wider viewport neither of them matches.

   A desktop mouse user (pointer:fine) at 1280px has no rail-tax touch layout
   and never hits this, so the fix is gated on pointer:coarse. min-width:1025px
   (not a max-width…coarse predicate) keeps this ADDITIVE above the drawer band
   and preserves the single-source coarse-tablet width the coordination guard
   (tests/test_breakpoint_coordination.py) locks at 1024. Same compaction as the
   ≤1024 block: move submenus + standalone launchers into the "···" sheet, pin
   the picker, and make the sheet + model dropdown reachable. Guarded by
   tests/test_preset_dropdown_coarse_escape.py. */
@media (pointer:coarse) and (min-width:1025px){
  #submenuExtras,#submenuFlow,#submenuMode,
  #imageGenBtn,#projectBtn{display:none!important}
  .mobile-more-btn{display:flex!important;width:40px;height:40px;align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;border:1.5px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:12px;background:var(--bg-tertiary);color:var(--text-secondary);
    cursor:pointer;box-sizing:border-box}
  /* Model picker must NOT shrink below a readable width now that the row has
   * room — pin a floor so it can never collapse to a sliver again. */
  #modelGroup{flex-shrink:0}
  .preset-toggle{flex-shrink:0;min-width:96px;max-width:200px}
}
/* ── Safe area insets for notched phones ──
 * env(safe-area-inset-*) resolves to 0px where unsupported, so these are
 * folded DIRECTLY into the mobile height/padding rules below (single source
 * of truth). A separate @supports block is NOT used: it would be overridden
 * by the later @media rules that redefine height/padding at equal specificity
 * and lose to source order — the original notch bug. */

/* ── Mobile: max-width 768px ── */
@media(max-width:768px){

  /* ===== OVERFLOW CONTAINMENT =====
   * Every level in the layout hierarchy must prevent horizontal overflow.
   * Theme-specific overrides (specificity 0,2,0) are repeated here to win. */
  html,body{overflow:hidden!important;overscroll-behavior:none}
  .main,.chat-wrapper,.chat-container,.chat-inner,
  .message,.message-content,.message-body,.md-content,
  .input-area,.input-inner{max-width:100%!important;overflow-x:hidden!important}
  /* Tofu theme sets overflow:visible on many containers for desktop dropdown popovers.
   * On mobile we MUST override all of them at matching specificity. */
  [data-theme="tofu"] .sidebar{position:fixed!important;overflow:hidden!important}
  [data-theme="tofu"] .sidebar.collapsed{transform:translateX(-100%)!important}
  [data-theme="tofu"] .sidebar:not(.collapsed){transform:translateX(0)!important}
  [data-theme="tofu"] .chat-wrapper,
  [data-theme="tofu"] .input-area,
  [data-theme="tofu"] .input-inner,
  [data-theme="tofu"] .input-actions,
  [data-theme="tofu"] .input-actions-scroll,
  [data-theme="tofu"] .input-group,
  [data-theme="tofu"] .toolbar-submenu,
  [data-theme="tofu"] .preset-toggle-wrapper{overflow:hidden!important;overflow-x:hidden!important;max-width:100%!important}

  /* ===== BODY & LAYOUT ===== */
  body{position:fixed!important;width:100%!important;height:100%!important;height:100dvh!important}
  .main{width:100%!important;flex:1!important;min-width:0!important;overflow:hidden!important}

  /* ===== SIDEBAR: slide-over drawer ===== */
  .sidebar{position:fixed!important;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:82vw;max-width:320px;min-width:auto!important;z-index:30;padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);transform:translateX(-100%);transition:transform .3s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1);box-shadow:none;will-change:transform}
  /* Derived desktop has-rail width must not widen the fixed phone drawer
   * (incl. the pre-paint html[data-rail] hint before JS adds .has-rail). */
  .sidebar.has-rail,.sidebar.has-rail.rail-collapsed,
  html[data-rail] .sidebar{width:82vw!important;max-width:320px;min-width:auto!important}
  .sidebar.collapsed{margin-left:0;transform:translateX(-100%)}
  .sidebar.has-rail.collapsed,.sidebar.has-rail.rail-collapsed.collapsed{margin-left:0!important}
  .sidebar:not(.collapsed){transform:translateX(0);box-shadow:4px 0 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.25)}
  .sidebar-header{padding:14px 16px}
  .sidebar-header h1{font-size:15px}
  /* Sidebar-header action buttons (search / settings) — 44px touch targets.
   * Specificity must beat `.sidebar-header-actions .action-btn` (0,2,0) and the
   * tofu `[data-theme="tofu"] .sidebar-header .action-btn` (0,3,0), so we match
   * the tofu selector and add !important as insurance. */
  .sidebar-header-actions .action-btn,
  [data-theme="tofu"] .sidebar-header .action-btn{width:44px!important;height:44px!important}
  .sidebar-header-actions{gap:4px}
  .sidebar-action-row{padding:10px 12px}
  .new-chat-btn{padding:10px 14px;font-size:13px}
  .sidebar-search-wrapper{padding:0 12px 10px}

  /* ===== CONVERSATION ITEMS: larger touch targets ===== */
  .conv-item{padding:12px 14px!important;min-height:48px}

  /* ===== TOPBAR: clean mobile header =====
   * Mobile topbar shows ONLY: hamburger | title | model badge
   * All feature badges, action buttons, and selectors are hidden.
   * Users access those features via sidebar or settings. */
  .topbar{height:calc(48px + env(safe-area-inset-top,0px));padding:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px) 10px 0;gap:8px;overflow:hidden!important;flex-wrap:nowrap}
  .topbar-title{font-size:14px;flex:1;min-width:0;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
  /* Hide ALL badges and action buttons — not enough room on 360px screens */
  .search-badge,.project-badge,.code-exec-badge,.browser-badge,
  .memory-badge,.scheduler-badge,.timer-trigger,
  #debugToggle,
  .topbar .action-btn{display:none!important}
  /* Model badge: keep it, right-aligned, compact */
  .model-badge{font-size:10px;padding:3px 8px;max-width:120px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;flex-shrink:0;margin-left:auto}
  /* Coarse phones no longer inherit the (now pointer:fine) ≤1080 label hide, so
   * strip the topbar tool labels HERE to keep the 360px header icon-only. */
  .topbar-tool-label,.update-btn-label{display:none}

  /* ===== PAPER READING MODE topbar =====
   * In reading mode the input bar (and its "···" sheet) is hidden, so the
   * ONLY exit affordance is the Paper button, which turns into a back-arrow
   * (#paperModeBtn.active). The .topbar-tools cluster is otherwise clipped by
   * overflow:hidden on a 360px screen, which could strand the user with no way
   * out. So when paper mode is active: keep ONLY the back button (44px touch
   * target, pinned right), hide the rest of the cluster. */
  .topbar-tools:has(#paperModeBtn.active) .topbar-tool-btn:not(#paperModeBtn),
  .topbar-tools:has(#paperModeBtn.active) .update-btn:not(#paperModeBtn){display:none!important}
  #paperModeBtn.active{display:inline-flex!important;min-width:44px;min-height:40px;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0}

  /* ===== CHAT AREA ===== */
  .chat-inner{padding:16px calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-right,0px)) 120px calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-left,0px));max-width:100%!important;overflow-x:hidden!important;word-break:break-word}
  .welcome-icon{width:52px;height:52px;font-size:22px;margin-bottom:14px}
  .welcome h2{font-size:20px}
  .welcome p{font-size:13px;max-width:320px}
  .feature-pills{gap:6px;margin-top:16px}
  .feature-pill{font-size:11px;padding:5px 10px}

  /* --- Messages: hide avatar, remove indent, bigger font --- */
  .message{gap:0;margin-bottom:16px;flex-direction:column;max-width:100%;overflow:hidden}
  .message-avatar{display:none}
  /* ConversationSurface keeps avatar, content, and the optional rail as
   * sibling grid items. Once the avatar is hidden, auto-placement otherwise
   * puts content into the intrinsic first track and collapses it to roughly
   * half the phone width. Own the mobile placement explicitly. */
  .conversation-turn.message > .conversation-turn-content{grid-column:1 / -1}
  .message-content{width:100%;overflow:hidden}
  .message-header{gap:8px;margin-bottom:4px}
  .message-role{font-size:13px}
  .message-time{font-size:10px}
  .stream-elapsed-timer{font-size:10px}
  .md-content{font-size:15px;line-height:1.75}
  .md-content pre code{padding:12px;font-size:12.5px}
  .md-content code{font-size:13px}
  .md-content h1{font-size:19px}
  .md-content h2{font-size:17px}
  .md-content h3{font-size:15px}
  .md-content th,.md-content td{padding:6px 8px;font-size:12px}
  .md-content ul,.md-content ol{margin-left:16px}
  .md-content blockquote{padding:6px 12px;font-size:14px}
  .message-body img:not(.ig-result-card img, .imagegen-card img, .ig-batch-slot img, .rf-img-tile img){max-width:200px;max-height:150px}
  .msg-img-thumb{width:60px;height:60px}
  .msg-img-badge{font-size:6px;padding:0 3px}
  .msg-img-size{font-size:7px}
  .code-header{padding:5px 10px;font-size:11px}

  /* --- Message actions: always visible on mobile (no hover) --- */
  .message-actions{opacity:1;position:relative;top:auto;right:auto;margin-top:4px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .msg-action-btn{padding:7px 12px;font-size:11px;min-height:44px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center}
  /* Tofu sets `.msg-action-btn{padding:3px 6px;font-size:10px}` at 0,2,0 which
   * beats the plain rule above (0,1,0): the button keeps its 44px min-height but
   * its cramped desktop padding/font, mismatching the other touch controls.
   * Re-assert comfortable touch padding/font at matching specificity. */
  [data-theme="tofu"] .msg-action-btn{padding:7px 12px;font-size:11px}
  /* Tofu decorative glyphs anchored OUTSIDE their box (negative left) are
   * clipped by the mobile overflow:hidden containers, so they render as dead
   * space or a sliver on narrow screens. The active-conv left-border and the
   * thinking-block frame already signal state — drop the ornaments on mobile. */
  [data-theme="tofu"] .conv-item.active::before{display:none!important}   /* pixel ▸ cursor */
  [data-theme="tofu"] .thinking-block::after{display:none!important}      /* thought-bubble dots */
  .delete-turn-popup{position:fixed;bottom:auto;top:50%;left:50%;right:auto;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);min-width:200px;max-width:calc(100vw - 32px);max-height:80dvh;max-height:calc(var(--vh100,100dvh)*0.8);overflow-y:auto}

  /* --- Thinking blocks --- */
  .thinking-header{padding:8px 12px}
  .thinking-label{font-size:13px}
  .thinking-text{padding:0 12px 12px;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.65}

  /* --- Search result blocks --- */
      .search-result-item{padding:8px 12px}
  .search-result-title{font-size:13px}
  .search-result-snippet{font-size:12px}

  /* ===== INPUT AREA: Mobile-first compact design =====
   * Layout: textarea on top, single-row toolbar below
   * Toolbar: [Model▾] [depth] [···] ――― [🔍] [⏎]
   * All submenus (增强/工具/模式) and standalone action btns
   * are hidden behind a "more" (···) button that opens a bottom sheet.
   * This keeps the toolbar to ~4 items on a 360px screen. */
  .input-area{padding:6px 8px calc(8px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px));max-width:100%!important;overflow:hidden!important;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
  .input-inner{max-width:100%!important;overflow:hidden!important;padding-left:env(safe-area-inset-left,0px);padding-right:env(safe-area-inset-right,0px);margin-left:0;margin-right:0;min-width:0}
  .input-box{border-radius:16px;margin-top:8px}
  textarea{font-size:16px;padding:12px 14px 10px;min-height:44px;max-height:140px}
  /* All toolbar controls share a single 40px touch-target height so the row
   * reads as one consistent band instead of mismatched 32/36/44px pills. */
  .send-btn{width:40px;height:40px;padding:0;border-radius:12px}

  /* --- Toolbar: single compact row --- */
  .input-actions{padding:8px 10px 10px;gap:8px;overflow:hidden!important;flex-wrap:nowrap}
  .input-actions::before{display:none}
  .input-actions-scroll{gap:8px;flex-shrink:1;min-width:0;overflow:visible}
  .input-actions-right{margin-left:auto;gap:8px;flex-shrink:0;align-items:center}
  .input-group{flex-shrink:1;min-width:0}

  /* --- Hide submenus & standalone action btns on mobile ---
   * These are accessible via the "more" (···) bottom sheet.
   * Only the model picker (#modelGroup) stays in the toolbar. */
  #submenuExtras,#submenuFlow,#submenuMode,#submenuAgentMode{display:none!important}

  /* --- Model picker: compact, 40px tall to match the other controls --- */
  .preset-toggle{height:40px;padding:0 10px;gap:5px;max-width:150px;overflow:hidden;box-sizing:border-box;align-items:center}
  .preset-toggle .ps-label{font-size:12px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
  .preset-toggle .ps-arrow{display:none}
  .preset-toggle .ps-icon{flex-shrink:0}
  #modelGroup{gap:8px;flex-shrink:1;min-width:0;overflow:visible;display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:nowrap}

  /* --- Thinking depth: hidden in the model dropdown on mobile (both the bar
   *     and its folded-in wrapper title) — mobile depth lives in the bottom
   *     sheet's .mobile-depth-bar, so the dropdown copy would be redundant. --- */
  .thinking-depth-bar{display:none!important}
  .ps-dd-depth-wrap{display:none!important}

  /* --- Search toggle: clean icon-only pill, square 40px to match the row --- */
  .search-mode-toggle{width:40px;height:40px;padding:0;gap:0;flex-shrink:0;border-radius:12px;min-width:40px;min-height:40px;box-sizing:border-box;justify-content:center}
  .search-mode-toggle .sm-label{display:none}
  .search-mode-toggle .sm-mode-pill{display:none}
  .search-mode-toggle .sm-icon{display:flex}
  .search-mode-toggle .sm-icon svg{width:17px;height:17px}

  /* --- "More" button — visible only on mobile --- */
  .mobile-more-btn{display:flex!important;width:40px;height:40px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    background:none;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;cursor:pointer;
    color:var(--text-secondary);flex-shrink:0;box-sizing:border-box;
    transition:background .15s,color .15s;padding:0;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
  .mobile-more-btn svg{width:18px;height:18px}
  .mobile-more-btn:active{background:var(--bg-hover)}
  .mobile-more-btn.has-active{color:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent)}

  /* --- Attach file button — now the leftmost control in the toolbar row
   *     (was a flex-end child of .input-row). Square 40px to match the band. --- */
  .attach-btn{display:flex!important;width:40px;height:40px;min-width:40px;margin:0;border-radius:12px;box-sizing:border-box;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0}
  .attach-btn svg{width:20px;height:20px}

  /* --- Portaled desktop popovers (timer / optimizer) as bottom sheets ---
   * mobile_panels.js re-parents #timerPanel / #optimizerPanel to <body> and
   * adds .mobile-panel-portaled. Their desktop absolute-position rules (anchored
   * to the now-hidden topbar badge) must be overridden to a full-width sheet. */
  .mobile-panel-backdrop{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3);z-index:259;
    display:none;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
  .mobile-panel-backdrop.open{display:block}
  .timer-panel.mobile-panel-portaled,
  .optimizer-panel.mobile-panel-portaled{position:fixed!important;top:auto!important;left:0!important;
    right:0!important;bottom:0!important;width:100%!important;max-width:100%!important;min-width:0!important;
    margin:0!important;border-radius:16px 16px 0 0!important;z-index:260!important;
    max-height:80dvh!important;max-height:calc(var(--vh100,100dvh)*0.8)!important;overflow-y:auto!important;
    padding-bottom:calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px))!important;
    transform:translateY(100%);transition:transform .25s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1);display:block!important}
  .timer-panel.mobile-panel-portaled.visible,
  .optimizer-panel.mobile-panel-portaled.visible{transform:translateY(0)}

  /* --- Preset/submenu dropdowns: bottom sheet style on mobile --- */
  .preset-dropdown{position:fixed;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;top:auto;transform:none;min-width:auto;width:100%;
    border-radius:16px 16px 0 0;padding:8px 8px calc(8px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px));
    max-height:60dvh;max-height:calc(var(--vh100,100vh) * 0.6);overflow-y:auto;z-index:200}
  .preset-toggle-wrapper.open .preset-dropdown{transform:none}
  .preset-dropdown-item{padding:12px 14px;border-radius:10px;font-size:13px;min-height:48px}
  .ps-dd-search{margin:-8px -8px 8px;top:-8px}

  /* (Legacy submenu dropdowns — still used if opened directly) */
  .submenu-dropdown{position:fixed;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;top:auto;transform:none;min-width:auto;width:100%;
    border-radius:16px 16px 0 0;padding:8px 8px calc(8px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px));
    max-height:60dvh;max-height:calc(var(--vh100,100dvh)*0.6);overflow-y:auto;z-index:200}
  .submenu-dropdown::after{display:none}
  .toolbar-submenu.open .submenu-dropdown{transform:none}
  .submenu-item{padding:12px 14px;gap:12px;min-height:48px}
  .submenu-item-name{font-size:14px}
  .submenu-item-desc{font-size:12px}
  .submenu-label{display:none}
  .submenu-arrow{display:none}

  /* Action buttons (those that remain visible) */
  .action-btn{width:44px;height:44px}
  #convRefBtn{display:none}

  /* ===== TOFU THEME: strip decorations on mobile =====
   * The mascot, grip wings, D-pad, sparkles, etc. eat too much
   * space on a 360px screen. Keep the warm colors but ditch the ornaments. */
  [data-theme="tofu"] .input-area{overflow:hidden!important;padding-top:6px!important}
  [data-theme="tofu"] .input-area::before,
  [data-theme="tofu"] .input-area::after{display:none!important}  /* sparkles */
  [data-theme="tofu"] .input-box{border-radius:var(--radius)!important;overflow:hidden!important;
    box-shadow:var(--clay-md)!important}
  [data-theme="tofu"] .input-box::before{display:none!important}  /* (retired) */
  [data-theme="tofu"] .input-box::after{display:none!important}   /* (retired) */
  [data-theme="tofu"] .input-row::before,
  [data-theme="tofu"] .input-row::after{display:none!important}   /* D-pad + dots */
  [data-theme="tofu"] .input-inner::before{display:none!important} /* speech bubble */
  [data-theme="tofu"] textarea{min-height:44px!important;padding:12px 14px 10px!important;font-size:15px!important}
  [data-theme="tofu"] .input-actions{padding:8px 10px 10px!important;gap:8px!important}
  /* Tofu theme sets its own padding/height on these controls (specificity
   * 0,2,0) which beats the plain mobile rules above — re-assert the unified
   * 40px square sizing at matching specificity so the row stays consistent. */
  [data-theme="tofu"] .search-mode-toggle{width:40px!important;height:40px!important;min-width:40px!important;padding:0!important;justify-content:center}
  [data-theme="tofu"] .preset-toggle{height:40px!important;padding:0 10px!important;box-sizing:border-box}
  [data-theme="tofu"] .send-btn{width:40px!important;height:40px!important}
  [data-theme="tofu"] .input-actions::before{display:none!important}
  [data-theme="tofu"] .input-actions-scroll .input-group:not(:last-child)::after{display:none!important}
  [data-theme="tofu"] .mobile-more-btn{border-color:var(--border);color:var(--text-primary);border-radius:var(--radius-xs)}
  [data-theme="tofu"] .attach-btn{color:var(--text-primary);border-radius:var(--radius-xs)}

  /* Input footer: hidden on mobile.
   * The hint only describes desktop affordances (Enter/Ctrl+Enter to send,
   * Shift+Enter newline, drag-and-drop file upload) — none of which apply on
   * a touch device, where sending is the ⏎ button and files come via the
   * attach (+) button. Removing it also frees vertical space, reducing the
   * cramped feel of the composer. */
  .input-footer{display:none!important}

  /* --- Turn navigation on mobile: COMPACT, never removed. Hiding the dots
   * outright used to leave touch users with no conversation-scale navigation
   * at all — the same "vanishing cliff" class as the desktop float. The
   * strip stays above the composer; the label goes, dots shrink, and the row
   * scrolls horizontally. --- */
  .turn-nav-label{display:none}
  .turn-dot{width:22px;height:22px;font-size:8px}

  /* --- Modals: full screen on mobile --- */
  .modal{padding:16px;padding-bottom:calc(16px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px));width:100%;max-width:100%;max-height:var(--vh100,100dvh);height:var(--vh100,100dvh);border-radius:0;border:none}
  .modal-overlay.open{align-items:stretch}
  .modal h3{font-size:16px;margin-bottom:16px}
  .modal .modal-actions{flex-wrap:wrap}
  .modal .btn{padding:12px 20px;font-size:14px;flex:1;min-width:0}

  /* Settings panel — stack tabs on top for mobile */
  .settings-panel{width:100%;max-width:100%;max-height:var(--vh100,100dvh);height:var(--vh100,100dvh);box-shadow:none;border-width:0;padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)}
  .settings-body{flex-direction:column}
  .settings-tabs{flex-direction:row;width:100%;min-width:0;border-right:none;border-bottom:3px solid #1a1814;padding:8px;overflow-x:auto;overflow-y:hidden}
  .settings-tab-group{display:none}
  .settings-tab{padding:7px 10px;font-size:11px}
  .settings-tab.active{box-shadow:2px 2px 0 var(--s-ink)}
  .settings-tab.active:active{box-shadow:1px 1px 0 var(--s-ink)}
  .settings-tab span{display:none}
  .settings-tab svg{margin:0}
  .settings-content{padding:16px}
  .settings-panel .theme-picker{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
    .stg-field-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .stg-edit-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .stg-mcard{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}
  .stg-mcard-actions{flex-direction:row;align-self:flex-end}
    .stg-provider-badges{flex-wrap:wrap}
  .stg-provider-body textarea{min-height:60px}
  
  /* Project modal — tabbed single-pane layout (one full-height pane at a time) */
  .project-modal{max-width:100%}
  .project-modal.pm-workbench{width:100%;max-width:100%;height:var(--vh100,100dvh);max-height:none}
  .pm-header{padding:14px 16px 12px}

  /* Segmented Browse / Workspace tabs */
  .pm-mobile-tabs{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-shrink:0;padding:10px 14px 0}
  .pm-mtab{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;
    padding:9px 12px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;
    color:var(--text-secondary);background:var(--bg-secondary);
    border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);cursor:pointer}
  .pm-mtab.active{color:var(--accent);background:var(--accent-subtle);border-color:var(--accent)}
  .pm-mtab-count{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;min-width:16px;height:16px;line-height:16px;
    text-align:center;border-radius:8px;padding:0 4px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff}
  .pm-mtab-count:empty{display:none}

  /* Single column; JS toggles which pane is visible via data-pm-view */
  .pm-body{display:flex;flex-direction:column;grid-template-columns:none;grid-template-rows:none;
    gap:0;padding:12px 14px;min-height:0;overflow:hidden}
  .pm-browser-pane,.pm-rail{flex:1 1 auto;min-height:0}
  .pm-workbench[data-pm-view="browse"] .pm-rail{display:none}
  .pm-workbench[data-pm-view="workspace"] .pm-browser-pane{display:none}
  .pm-browser-pane .folder-browser-list{min-height:0;max-height:none;flex:1 1 auto}
  .pm-rail{gap:12px}
  .pm-rail-workspace{max-height:none;flex:1 1 auto}
  .pm-rail .recent-paths{flex:0 0 auto;max-height:40%}
  .pm-workbench .modal-actions{padding:12px 14px}
  .pm-workbench #projectModalStatus:not(:empty){margin:0 14px}

  /* Memory modal */
  .memory-modal{max-width:100%}
  .memory-list{max-height:50dvh;max-height:calc(var(--vh100,100dvh)*0.5)}

  /* --- Debug panel: full width bottom --- */
  .debug-panel{right:0;left:0;bottom:0;width:100%;max-width:100%;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;max-height:50dvh;max-height:calc(var(--vh100,100dvh)*0.5);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)}

  /* --- Image previews --- */
  /* --- Preview modal: preview-body fills the overlay so tapping outside the panel
   *   hits preview-body (not the tiny overlay gap) and triggers closePreview(). --- */
  #previewModal.open{align-items:stretch;justify-content:center}
  .preview-body{max-width:none;max-height:none;width:100%;height:100%;padding:16px;box-sizing:border-box}
  .preview-text-panel{width:100%;max-height:calc(100dvh - 32px);max-height:calc(var(--vh100,100dvh) - 32px);border-radius:8px}
  .preview-close-btn{top:12px;right:12px;width:40px;height:40px;font-size:22px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.18)}

  .img-preview{width:52px;height:52px}

  /* --- Project bar --- */
  .project-bar{padding:6px 10px;font-size:11px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .project-bar-folders{max-width:60vw}

  /* --- Finish tags --- */
  .message-finish{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px}
  .finish-tag,.token-tag{font-size:9px;padding:2px 6px}

  /* --- File changes bar --- */
  .fc-summary{padding:5px 8px;gap:4px}
  .fc-summary-text{font-size:10px}
  .fc-file{font-size:10px;gap:4px}
  .fc-icon{width:14px;height:14px;font-size:10px}

  /* --- Toast --- */
  .toast-container{left:8px;right:8px;bottom:auto;top:8px}

  /* --- Export preview --- */
  .export-preview-overlay{padding:20px 8px}
  .export-preview-overlay .epv-toolbar{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;padding:10px 14px}
  .export-preview-overlay .epv-card img{height:200px}

  /* --- Log clean banner --- */
  .log-clean-banner{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch}
  .log-clean-banner-actions{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px}
  .log-clean-btn{flex:1;min-width:0;justify-content:center}

  /* --- PDF progress --- */
  .pdf-progress{font-size:11px}

  /* --- Bilingual blocks --- */
  .bilingual-header{padding:6px 10px}
  .bilingual-body .md-content{padding:0 10px 8px;font-size:12px}
}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   ★ SINGLE SOURCE — bottom-sheet CONTAINER + CONTENT for every
   touch/narrow viewport that can OPEN the "···" sheet.
   Union = ≤768 (any pointer) + 769–1024 coarse + ≥1025 coarse.
   Placed AFTER all three width blocks so it is never reverse-bitten
   at equal specificity. fine-pointer desktops keep the full toolbar and
   never open this sheet, so the (pointer:coarse) arm can't leak the sheet
   layout onto them. The per-width blocks keep ONLY their real differences
   (.mobile-more-btn value, #modelGroup pin, submenu hides, drawer geometry,
   .preset-dropdown, topbar). Guarded by
   tests/test_mobile_sheet_content_reaches_wide_coarse.py. Historic bug: the
   container was copied into all 3 width blocks but the content into only 2
   (≤768 + 769–1024 coarse) → a ≥1025 coarse tablet popped an UNSTYLED sheet
   (bare-text rows / naked depth buttons). Single source ends that class. */
@media (max-width:768px),(pointer:coarse){
  /* ── Container + backdrop + flow-sheet ── */
  .mobile-bottom-sheet{position:fixed;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:250;
    background:var(--bg-secondary);border-radius:16px 16px 0 0;
    box-shadow:0 -4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);padding:12px 12px calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px));
    max-height:70dvh;max-height:calc(var(--vh100,100vh) * 0.7);overflow-y:auto;transform:translateY(100%);transition:transform .25s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1);
    display:none}
  .mobile-bottom-sheet.open{display:block;transform:translateY(0)}
  .mobile-bottom-sheet-backdrop{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3);z-index:249;
    display:none;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
  .mobile-bottom-sheet-backdrop.open{display:block}
  .mobile-flow-sheet{z-index:260}
  .mobile-flow-sheet .flow-catalog-notice{margin:0 8px 8px;padding:9px 10px;font-size:12px}

  /* ── Sheet content ── */
  .mobile-sheet-header{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text-secondary);padding:4px 8px 10px;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:8px}
  .mobile-sheet-section{margin-bottom:8px}
  .mobile-sheet-section-title{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text-tertiary);
    text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;padding:4px 8px}
  .mobile-sheet-section-subtitle{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text-tertiary);letter-spacing:.04em;padding:8px 8px 3px}
  .mobile-workflow-section{padding-top:2px}
  .mobile-workflow-manage{display:block;width:calc(100% - 16px);margin:4px 8px 2px;padding:11px 12px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;background:var(--bg-tertiary);color:var(--accent);font:700 13px/1.2 inherit;cursor:pointer}
  .mobile-workflow-empty{padding:16px 10px;color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:12px;line-height:1.45;text-align:center}
  .mobile-sheet-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;width:100%;padding:12px 10px;border:0;border-radius:10px;background:transparent;color:inherit;font:inherit;text-align:left;
    cursor:pointer;transition:background .12s;user-select:none;min-height:44px}
  .mobile-sheet-item:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:-2px}
  .mobile-sheet-item:active{background:var(--bg-hover)}
  .mobile-sheet-item.active{background:var(--accent-subtle)}
  .mobile-sheet-item-icon{width:20px;height:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    color:var(--text-secondary);flex-shrink:0}
  .mobile-sheet-item.active .mobile-sheet-item-icon{color:var(--accent)}
  .mobile-sheet-item-text{flex:1;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
  .mobile-sheet-item-name{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-primary);line-height:1.3}
  .mobile-sheet-item.active .mobile-sheet-item-name{color:var(--accent)}
  .mobile-sheet-item-desc{font-size:11px;color:var(--text-tertiary);margin-top:2px;line-height:1.3}
  .mobile-sheet-item-check{font-size:14px;color:var(--accent);opacity:0}
  .mobile-sheet-item.active .mobile-sheet-item-check{opacity:1}
  .mobile-sheet-item.disabled,.mobile-sheet-item:disabled{pointer-events:none;opacity:0.45}
  .mobile-sheet-item.disabled .mobile-sheet-item-check,.mobile-sheet-item:disabled .mobile-sheet-item-check{opacity:0}
  .mobile-depth-bar{display:flex;gap:6px;padding:6px 8px}
  .mobile-depth-btn{flex:1;padding:10px 0;border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;
    background:var(--bg-tertiary);color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;
    cursor:pointer;text-align:center;transition:all .15s;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
  .mobile-depth-btn:active{transform:scale(.96)}
  .mobile-depth-btn.active{background:var(--accent-subtle);color:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent)}

  /* ── tofu theme variants (superset from the former ≤768 block) ── */
  [data-theme="tofu"] .mobile-bottom-sheet{background:var(--bg-secondary);border:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:none}
  [data-theme="tofu"] .mobile-sheet-item{font-family:var(--sans-body);font-size:13px}
  [data-theme="tofu"] .mobile-sheet-item.active{background:var(--accent-subtle)}
  [data-theme="tofu"] .mobile-sheet-item-name{color:var(--text-primary)}
  [data-theme="tofu"] .mobile-sheet-item.active .mobile-sheet-item-name{color:var(--accent)}
  [data-theme="tofu"] .mobile-sheet-item-check{color:var(--accent)}
  [data-theme="tofu"] .mobile-depth-btn{font-family:var(--sans-body);font-size:12px;
    border-color:rgba(194,188,164,0.4);color:#5C4A33;background:#FAF8F3}
  [data-theme="tofu"] .mobile-depth-btn.active{background:rgba(196,149,106,0.15);
    color:#6A4E2E;border-color:#A67B52}
}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   ★ My Day — NEO-BRUTALIST TOFU BLOCK
   The entire modal IS a block of tofu.
   Hard shadows · Thick borders · Physical press-down · Kintsugi gold
   ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

/* ── Palette ── */
.myday-modal {
  /* The tofu itself */
  --tf-white:     #faf7f2;
  --tf-cream:     #f0ead6;
  --tf-skin:      #e8dcc8;
  /* The cutting board (sidebar) */
  --tf-board:     #3a322a;
  --tf-board-lit: #4a4238;
  /* Kintsugi gold */
  --tf-gold:      #d4a850;
  --tf-gold-dim:  #b8923a;
  /* Ink (borders, text) */
  --tf-ink:       #1a1814;
  --tf-ink-soft:  #3a342a;
  /* Status */
  --tf-done:      #4ade80;
  --tf-progress:  #fbbf24;
  --tf-blocked:   #f87171;
  /* Brutalist shadow offset */
  --tf-shadow:    6px 6px 0 var(--tf-ink);
  --tf-shadow-sm: 4px 4px 0 var(--tf-ink);
  --tf-shadow-xs: 3px 3px 0 var(--tf-ink);
  /* Border */
  --tf-border:    3px solid var(--tf-ink);
  --tf-border-sm: 2px solid var(--tf-ink);
}

/* ── Light theme adjustments ── */
[data-theme="light"] .myday-modal {
  --tf-white:     #fefcf8;
  --tf-cream:     #f5f0e0;
  --tf-skin:      #ede4d2;
  --tf-board:     #2e2820;
  --tf-board-lit: #3e3830;
  --tf-ink:       #141210;
  --tf-ink-soft:  #302a22;
}

/* ══════════════════════════════════════
   MODAL — the tofu block itself
   ══════════════════════════════════════ */
.myday-modal {
  display: flex;
  width: 780px;
  max-width: 96vw;
  max-height: 88vh;
  max-height: calc(var(--vh100,100vh)*0.88);
  background: var(--tf-white);
  border: var(--tf-border);
  border-width: 4px;
  box-shadow: 10px 10px 0 var(--tf-ink);
  border-radius: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  font-family: 'Inter', 'SF Pro', -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif;
  color: var(--tf-ink);
  animation: tofuSlam 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.2, 1.2, 0.4, 1) both;
  position: relative;
}
.myday-modal * { box-sizing: border-box; }

/* Slam-in: the tofu block drops onto the cutting board */
@keyframes tofuSlam {
  0%   { transform: translateY(-40px) scale(0.96); opacity: 0; }
  60%  { transform: translateY(4px) scale(1.01); opacity: 1; }
  100% { transform: translateY(0) scale(1); opacity: 1; }
}

/* ═══ Kintsugi crack — diagonal gold hairline across the modal ═══ */
.myday-modal::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 1;
  background:
    linear-gradient(135deg,
      transparent 42%,
      var(--tf-gold) 42.2%, var(--tf-gold) 42.5%,
      transparent 42.7%
    );
  opacity: 0.12;
}

/* ══════════════════════════════════════
   LEFT: Main panel
   ══════════════════════════════════════ */
.myday-main {
  flex: 1;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  min-width: 0;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
}

/* ── Header — thick bottom border like a tofu slice line ── */
.myday-header {
  padding: 20px 24px 14px;
  border-bottom: var(--tf-border);
  background: var(--tf-cream);
  position: relative;
}
/* Gold kintsugi line under header */
.myday-header::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  bottom: -2px;
  left: 20px;
  right: 20px;
  height: 2px;
  background: var(--tf-gold);
  opacity: 0.5;
}

.myday-header-top {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 12px;
}
.myday-title-area {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  min-width: 0;
}

/* ── Tofu face mascot — a little tofu block with a face ── */
.myday-tofu-face {
  width: 44px;
  height: 44px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background: var(--tf-white);
  border: var(--tf-border-sm);
  box-shadow: var(--tf-shadow-xs);
  flex-shrink: 0;
  transition: transform 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;
  color: var(--tf-ink);
}
.myday-tofu-face:hover {
  transform: translate(2px, 2px);
  box-shadow: 1px 1px 0 var(--tf-ink);
}

.myday-title {
  font-size: 22px;
  font-weight: 900;
  letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  color: var(--tf-ink);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  line-height: 1.1;
}
.myday-subtitle {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--tf-ink-soft);
  margin: 2px 0 0;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

/* ── Header action buttons — tofu blocks ── */
.myday-header-actions {
  display: flex;
  gap: 8px;
  align-items: center;
}
.myday-refresh-btn,
.myday-close {
  width: 36px;
  height: 36px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background: var(--tf-white);
  border: var(--tf-border-sm);
  box-shadow: var(--tf-shadow-xs);
  cursor: pointer;
  color: var(--tf-ink);
  transition: transform 0.1s, box-shadow 0.1s, background 0.1s;
  padding: 0;
}
.myday-refresh-btn:hover,
.myday-close:hover {
  transform: translate(1px, 1px);
  box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--tf-ink);
  background: var(--tf-cream);
}
.myday-refresh-btn:active,
.myday-close:active {
  transform: translate(3px, 3px);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 var(--tf-ink);
}
.myday-close:hover { background: var(--tf-blocked); color: var(--tf-white); }

/* Spin animation for refresh */
.myday-refresh-btn.spinning svg {
  animation: brutSpin 0.6s linear infinite;
}
@keyframes brutSpin {
  to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
}

/* ── Progress bar — thick bar with hard shadow ── */
.myday-progress {
  margin-top: 10px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  min-height: 0;
}
.myday-progress:empty { display: none; }
.myday-prog-track {
  flex: 1;
  height: 14px;
  background: var(--tf-skin);
  border: var(--tf-border-sm);
  box-shadow: var(--tf-shadow-xs);
  overflow: hidden;
  position: relative;
}
.myday-prog-fill {
  height: 100%;
  width: 0;
  background: var(--tf-done);
  border-right: 2px solid var(--tf-ink);
  transition: width 0.5s ease;
}
.myday-prog-label {
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--tf-ink);
  min-width: 40px;
  text-align: right;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}

/* ══════════════════════════════════════
   TASK LIST — scrollable area
   ══════════════════════════════════════ */
.myday-tasks-scroll {
  flex: 1;
  overflow-y: auto;
  padding: 16px 20px 20px;
  scrollbar-width: thin;
  scrollbar-color: var(--tf-skin) transparent;
}

/* ── Section labels — stamped ── */
.myday-section-label {
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 900;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  color: var(--tf-ink-soft);
  padding: 0 2px;
  margin: 20px 0 8px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
}
.myday-section-label:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
.myday-section-label .myday-accountability-bar { margin-left: 4px; }
.myday-section-count {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  min-width: 20px;
  height: 20px;
  padding: 0 6px;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 800;
  background: var(--tf-ink);
  color: var(--tf-white);
  border: none;
}
/* ══════════════════════
   Stream card — a tofu block
   ══════════════════════ */
.myday-stream {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 12px;
  padding: 12px 14px;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  background: var(--tf-white);
  border: var(--tf-border-sm);
  box-shadow: var(--tf-shadow-sm);
  cursor: default;
  transition: transform 0.1s, box-shadow 0.1s;
  animation: cardEnter 0.2s ease both;
}
.myday-stream:hover {
  transform: translate(-1px, -1px);
  box-shadow: 7px 7px 0 var(--tf-ink);
}
.myday-stream:active {
  transform: translate(2px, 2px);
  box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--tf-ink);
}
.myday-stream.enter { animation: cardEnter 0.25s ease both; }

@keyframes cardEnter {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); }
  to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}

/* ── Status dot — square tofu piece ── */
.myday-dot {
  width: 18px;
  height: 18px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  border: var(--tf-border-sm);
  cursor: pointer;
  margin-top: 2px;
  transition: transform 0.1s, box-shadow 0.1s, background 0.1s;
  box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--tf-ink);
}
.myday-dot:hover {
  transform: translate(1px, 1px);
  box-shadow: 1px 1px 0 var(--tf-ink);
}
.myday-dot:active {
  transform: translate(2px, 2px);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 var(--tf-ink);
}
.myday-dot.s-done       { background: var(--tf-done); }
.myday-dot.s-incomplete  { background: transparent; }

/* ── Stream body ── */
.myday-stream-body {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
}
.myday-stream-title {
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--tf-ink);
  line-height: 1.3;
}
.myday-stream-summary {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--tf-ink-soft);
  margin-top: 4px;
  line-height: 1.5;
}
.myday-stream-convs {
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--tf-ink-soft);
  margin-top: 4px;
  padding: 2px 8px;
  background: var(--tf-cream);
  border: 1px solid var(--tf-ink);
  display: inline-block;
}
/* Done stream — muted */
.myday-stream.s-done {
  opacity: 0.6;
  background: var(--tf-cream);
}
.myday-stream.s-done .myday-stream-title {
  text-decoration: line-through;
  text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
}

/* ══════════════════════════════════════
   Tomorrow TODO items
   ══════════════════════════════════════ */
.myday-tomorrow { margin-bottom: 4px; }
.myday-todo-item {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  padding: 8px 12px;
  margin-bottom: 4px;
  background: var(--tf-white);
  border: 1px solid var(--tf-ink);
  box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--tf-ink);
  transition: transform 0.1s, box-shadow 0.1s;
  animation: cardEnter 0.2s ease both;
}
.myday-todo-item:hover {
  transform: translate(-1px, -1px);
  box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--tf-ink);
}
.myday-todo-item.done {
  opacity: 0.5;
  background: var(--tf-cream);
}
.myday-todo-item.done .myday-todo-text {
  text-decoration: line-through;
  text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
}
.myday-todo-check {
  width: 18px;
  height: 18px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background: var(--tf-white);
  border: var(--tf-border-sm);
  cursor: pointer;
  padding: 0;
  transition: background 0.15s;
}
.myday-todo-check:hover { background: var(--tf-cream); }
.myday-todo-check.checked { background: var(--tf-done); }
.myday-todo-check svg { opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.15s; }
.myday-todo-check.checked svg { opacity: 1; }
.myday-todo-text {
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--tf-ink);
  flex: 1;
}
.myday-todo-del {
  width: 18px;
  height: 18px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background: var(--tf-white);
  border: var(--tf-border-sm);
  cursor: pointer;
  padding: 0;
  color: var(--tf-ink-soft);
  opacity: 0;
  transition: opacity 0.15s, background 0.15s, transform 0.1s, box-shadow 0.1s, color 0.15s;
}
.myday-todo-item:hover .myday-todo-del { opacity: 0.6; }
.myday-todo-del:hover {
  opacity: 1 !important;
  background: #fee2e2;
  color: #dc2626;
  transform: translate(-1px, -1px);
  box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--tf-ink);
}
.myday-todo-del:active {
  transform: translate(1px, 1px);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 var(--tf-ink);
}
/* Launch conversation button */
.myday-todo-launch {
  width: 22px;
  height: 22px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background: var(--tf-white);
  border: var(--tf-border-sm);
  cursor: pointer;
  padding: 0;
  color: var(--tf-accent, #6366f1);
  opacity: 0;
  transition: opacity 0.15s, background 0.15s, transform 0.1s, box-shadow 0.1s, color 0.15s;
}
.myday-todo-item:hover .myday-todo-launch { opacity: 0.7; }
.myday-todo-launch:hover {
  opacity: 1 !important;
  background: #eef2ff;
  color: #4f46e5;
  transform: translate(-1px, -1px);
  box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--tf-ink);
}
.myday-todo-launch:active {
  transform: translate(1px, 1px);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 var(--tf-ink);
}

/* ══════════════════════════════════════
   Add TODO — dashed slot with tofu-block ＋ button
   ══════════════════════════════════════ */
.myday-add-todo {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  padding: 10px 12px;
  margin-top: 12px;
  border: 2px dashed var(--tf-ink-soft);
  background: transparent;
  opacity: 0.45;
  transition: opacity 0.2s, border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
}
.myday-add-todo:focus-within {
  opacity: 1;
  border-color: var(--tf-ink);
  background: var(--tf-white);
  box-shadow: var(--tf-shadow-xs);
}
.myday-add-btn {
  width: 22px;
  height: 22px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background: var(--tf-white);
  border: var(--tf-border-sm);
  box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--tf-ink);
  cursor: pointer;
  padding: 0;
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 900;
  line-height: 1;
  color: var(--tf-ink);
  transition: transform 0.1s, box-shadow 0.1s, background 0.1s;
}
.myday-add-btn:hover {
  background: var(--tf-gold);
  transform: translate(-1px, -1px);
  box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--tf-ink);
}
.myday-add-btn:active {
  transform: translate(2px, 2px);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 var(--tf-ink);
}
.myday-todo-input {
  flex: 1;
  background: transparent;
  border: none;
  outline: none;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--tf-ink);
  font-family: inherit;
}
.myday-todo-input::placeholder {
  color: var(--tf-ink-soft);
  opacity: 0.6;
}

/* ══════════════════════════════════════
   Today TODOs (inherited) + accountability bar
   ══════════════════════════════════════ */
.myday-today-todos { margin-bottom: 4px; }
.myday-todo-item.inherited {
  border-left: 3px solid var(--tf-gold);
}
.myday-inherited-badge {
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 800;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  color: var(--tf-gold);
  border: 1px solid var(--tf-gold);
  padding: 1px 5px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  opacity: 0.7;
}
.myday-accountability-bar {
  display: inline-block;
  width: 48px;
  height: 6px;
  background: var(--tf-cream);
  border: 1px solid var(--tf-ink);
  vertical-align: middle;
  margin-left: 6px;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.myday-accountability-fill {
  display: block;
  height: 100%;
  background: var(--tf-done);
  transition: width 0.3s ease;
}

/* ══════════════════════════════════════
   Stats footer bar — stamped label
   ══════════════════════════════════════ */
.myday-stats-bar {
  padding: 8px 24px;
  border-top: var(--tf-border);
  background: var(--tf-cream);
  min-height: 0;
  position: relative;
}
.myday-stats-bar:empty { display: none; }
/* Gold kintsugi line above footer */
.myday-stats-bar::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  top: -2px;
  left: 20px;
  right: 20px;
  height: 2px;
  background: var(--tf-gold);
  opacity: 0.4;
}
.myday-stat {
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--tf-ink-soft);
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

/* ══════════════════════════════════════
   Skeleton loading — tofu slabs shimmer
   ══════════════════════════════════════ */
.myday-task-skel {
  display: flex;
  gap: 12px;
  align-items: flex-start;
  padding: 12px 14px;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  border: var(--tf-border-sm);
  box-shadow: var(--tf-shadow-sm);
  background: var(--tf-white);
}
.skel-check {
  width: 18px;
  height: 18px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  border: var(--tf-border-sm);
  background: var(--tf-skin);
  animation: skelPulse 1s ease infinite alternate;
}
.skel-body { flex: 1; }
.skel-line {
  height: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  background: var(--tf-skin);
  border: 1px solid var(--tf-ink-soft);
  animation: skelPulse 1s ease infinite alternate;
}
.skel-line:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.skel-line.w75 { width: 75%; }
.skel-line.w45 { width: 45%; }
@keyframes skelPulse {
  from { opacity: 0.4; }
  to   { opacity: 0.8; }
}

/* ══════════════════════════════════════
   Generate button — big tofu block CTA
   ══════════════════════════════════════ */
.myday-generate-btn {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  margin-top: 14px;
  padding: 12px 28px;
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 900;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  color: var(--tf-ink);
  background: var(--tf-gold);
  border: var(--tf-border);
  box-shadow: var(--tf-shadow);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: transform 0.1s, box-shadow 0.1s;
  font-family: inherit;
}
.myday-generate-btn:hover {
  transform: translate(-2px, -2px);
  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--tf-ink);
}
.myday-generate-btn:active {
  transform: translate(4px, 4px);
  box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--tf-ink);
}
.myday-generate-btn.loading {
  pointer-events: none;
  opacity: 0.6;
}

/* Inherited-only prompt — nudge to generate report */
.myday-inherited-prompt {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 10px;
  margin: 10px 0 6px;
  padding: 10px 14px;
  border: 2px dashed var(--tf-mid);
  background: var(--tf-cream);
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--tf-ink);
}
.myday-inherited-prompt .myday-generate-btn {
  margin-top: 0;
  padding: 6px 16px;
  font-size: 12px;
}

/* ══════════════════════════════════════
   Empty state
   ══════════════════════════════════════ */
.myday-empty {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 48px 24px 28px;
  text-align: center;
  min-height: 200px;
}
.myday-empty-tofu {
  color: var(--tf-ink-soft);
  opacity: 0.4;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.myday-empty-title {
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 900;
  color: var(--tf-ink);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
}
.myday-empty-hint {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--tf-ink-soft);
  margin-top: 6px;
  font-weight: 600;
}

/* ══════════════════════════════════════
   Progress UI — generation in progress
   ══════════════════════════════════════ */
.myday-generating {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 36px 20px 24px;
  text-align: center;
  min-height: 200px;
}

/* Spinning tofu block */
.myday-gen-spinner {
  width: 36px;
  height: 36px;
  border: var(--tf-border);
  background: var(--tf-gold);
  box-shadow: var(--tf-shadow-xs);
  animation: tofuSpin 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.5, 0, 0.5, 1) infinite;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}
@keyframes tofuSpin {
  0%   { transform: rotate(0deg); }
  25%  { transform: rotate(90deg)  scale(0.9); }
  50%  { transform: rotate(180deg) scale(1); }
  75%  { transform: rotate(270deg) scale(0.9); }
  100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }
}

.myday-gen-title {
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 900;
  color: var(--tf-ink);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
}
.myday-gen-message {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--tf-ink-soft);
  margin-top: 6px;
  font-weight: 600;
}
.myday-gen-hint {
  font-size: 11px;
  color: var(--tf-ink-soft);
  margin-top: 16px;
  opacity: 0.6;
  font-weight: 600;
}

/* Steps — horizontal tofu blocks */
.myday-gen-steps {
  display: flex;
  gap: 6px;
  margin-top: 20px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  justify-content: center;
}
.myday-gen-step {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 5px;
  padding: 6px 12px;
  background: var(--tf-cream);
  border: 1px solid var(--tf-ink-soft);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--tf-ink-soft);
  opacity: 0.5;
  transition: all 0.2s;
}
.myday-gen-step.active {
  opacity: 1;
  background: var(--tf-gold);
  border-color: var(--tf-ink);
  color: var(--tf-ink);
  box-shadow: var(--tf-shadow-xs);
  animation: stepPulse 1.5s ease infinite;
}
.myday-gen-step.done {
  opacity: 0.7;
  background: var(--tf-done);
  border-color: var(--tf-ink);
  color: var(--tf-ink);
}
.myday-gen-step-dot { font-size: 12px; }
.myday-gen-step-label { font-size: 11px; }

@keyframes stepPulse {
  0%, 100% { box-shadow: var(--tf-shadow-xs); }
  50% { box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--tf-gold-dim), 0 0 0 2px var(--tf-gold); }
}

/* ══════════════════════════════════════
   RIGHT SIDEBAR — the cutting board
   ══════════════════════════════════════ */
.myday-sidebar {
  width: 210px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  background: var(--tf-board);
  border-left: 4px solid var(--tf-ink);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  padding: 14px 12px 12px;
  overflow-y: auto;
}

/* ── Calendar header ── */
.myday-cal-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}
.mcal-nav {
  width: 28px;
  height: 28px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background: var(--tf-board-lit);
  border: 2px solid var(--tf-gold-dim);
  color: var(--tf-gold);
  cursor: pointer;
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 900;
  padding: 0;
  transition: transform 0.1s, box-shadow 0.1s;
  box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
}
.mcal-nav:hover {
  transform: translate(1px, 1px);
  box-shadow: 1px 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  background: var(--tf-gold-dim);
  color: var(--tf-ink);
}
.mcal-nav:active {
  transform: translate(2px, 2px);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 transparent;
}
.mcal-title {
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 900;
  color: var(--tf-gold);
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

/* ── Calendar grid ── */
.myday-cal-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(7, 1fr);
  gap: 2px;
}
.mcal-wk {
  font-size: 9px;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--tf-gold-dim);
  text-align: center;
  padding: 4px 0 6px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
}
.mcal-d {
  aspect-ratio: 1;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--tf-cream);
  cursor: pointer;
  position: relative;
  transition: transform 0.1s, box-shadow 0.1s, background 0.1s;
  border: 1px solid transparent;
}
.mcal-d:not(.empty):hover {
  background: var(--tf-board-lit);
  border-color: var(--tf-gold-dim);
}
.mcal-d.empty { cursor: default; }
.mcal-d.today {
  color: var(--tf-ink);
  background: var(--tf-gold);
  border: 2px solid var(--tf-ink);
  box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  font-weight: 900;
}
.mcal-d.sel {
  color: var(--tf-ink);
  background: var(--tf-cream);
  border: 2px solid var(--tf-ink);
  box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
}
.mcal-d.future { opacity: 0.3; cursor: default; }
.mcal-d.quiet { opacity: 0.45; }

/* Status dots under calendar days */
.mcal-dot {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 2px;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  width: 5px;
  height: 5px;
  border: 1px solid var(--tf-ink);
}
.mcal-dot.done    { background: var(--tf-done); }
.mcal-dot.open    { background: var(--tf-progress); }
.mcal-dot.unknown { background: var(--tf-cream); opacity: 0.4; }
.mcal-dot.generating {
  background: var(--tf-gold);
  animation: dotBlink 0.8s infinite;
}
@keyframes dotBlink {
  0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
  50% { opacity: 0.2; }
}

/* ── Calendar legend ── */
.myday-cal-legend {
  display: flex;
  gap: 10px;
  justify-content: center;
  margin-top: 12px;
  padding-top: 10px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--tf-gold-dim);
}
.cal-legend-item {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 4px;
  font-size: 9px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--tf-gold-dim);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
}
.cal-dot {
  width: 8px;
  height: 8px;
  border: 1px solid var(--tf-ink);
}
.cal-dot.done { background: var(--tf-done); }
.cal-dot.open { background: var(--tf-progress); }

/* ── Sidebar info (daily cost) ── */
.myday-cal-info {
  margin-top: 12px;
  padding: 0 2px;
}
.mcal-info-label {
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--tf-gold);
  padding: 6px 10px;
  background: var(--tf-board-lit);
  border: 1px solid var(--tf-gold-dim);
  text-align: center;
}

/* ══════════════════════════════════════
   RESPONSIVE
   ══════════════════════════════════════ */
@media (max-width: 680px) {
  .myday-modal {
    flex-direction: column;
    max-height: 92vh;
    max-height: calc(var(--vh100,100vh)*0.92);
    box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--tf-ink);
  }
  .myday-sidebar {
    width: 100%;
    border-left: none;
    border-top: 4px solid var(--tf-ink);
    flex-direction: row;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    max-height: 200px;
    overflow-y: auto;
  }
  .myday-cal-header { margin-bottom: 4px; width: 100%; }
  .myday-cal-grid { width: 100%; }
  .myday-cal-legend { width: 100%; }
  .myday-cal-info { display: none; }
  .myday-header { padding: 16px 18px 10px; }
  .myday-tasks-scroll { padding: 4px 14px 16px; }
  .myday-stats-bar { padding: 6px 18px; }
  .myday-title { font-size: 18px; }
}
/* ── Small phones: max-width 380px ── */
@media(max-width:380px){
  .topbar{padding:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px) 8px 0;gap:6px}
  .topbar-title{font-size:13px}
  .model-badge{font-size:9px;padding:2px 6px;max-width:90px}
  .chat-inner{padding:12px 8px 110px}
  .input-area{padding:6px 6px 10px}
  textarea{font-size:16px;padding:10px 12px 8px}
  .welcome h2{font-size:18px}
  .welcome p{font-size:12px}
  .md-content{font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7}
  .md-content pre code{font-size:10px;padding:10px}
  .submenu-trigger{padding:3px 6px}
  .preset-toggle{padding:3px 6px 3px 5px}
}

/* ── Landscape phones ──
 * Was `max-height:500px` only, which missed the many 540–599px-tall landscape
 * handsets (and split-screen slices). Anchor it on orientation:landscape and
 * raise the short-viewport ceiling to 600px so the whole class is covered,
 * while the max-width:900px guard keeps it off genuine landscape tablets. */
@media(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:600px) and (max-width:900px){
  .topbar{height:calc(40px + env(safe-area-inset-top,0px));padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px)}
  .chat-inner{padding:10px calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-right,0px)) 100px calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-left,0px))}
  .input-area{padding:6px 10px 8px}
  textarea{min-height:36px}
  .welcome{min-height:40vh}
  .welcome-icon{width:40px;height:40px;font-size:18px;margin-bottom:10px}
  .welcome h2{font-size:18px}
}

/* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   ★ Pre-tool indicator chips (Memory Prefetch + MCP Login Hint)
   ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   These chips render in the assistant bubble ABOVE the unified tool
   activity panel. Visual language is intentionally harmonised with
   the tool panel directly below so the two feel like one continuous
   element instead of two transplanted styles:
      .ptool-panel  →  .mem-prefetch-chip
   Shared tokens:
     – warm amber/gold palette (rgba(234,179,8,*), rgba(245,158,11,*))
     – border-radius:var(--radius-sm) (=8px by default)
     – JetBrains Mono 11.5px body / 12px header
     – flat 1px border with a very subtle tinted background
     – no gradient, no heavy glow, no pulsing when idle
   Status variants (mp-running / mp-done / mp-failed / mp-skipped) map
   to the same semantic color pattern the tool panel uses: amber for
   in-flight, green for success, red for failure, slate for skip. */

/* ── Unified turn-provenance strip ──────────────────────────────────
   ONE quiet line at the head of an assistant turn that merges the old
   stacked boxes (memory-prefetch + preferences-applied + resolved
   login). Collapsed = icon segments + tiny counts; click → reveals the
   full labels, the picked-memory list, and which preferences were in
   context. The awaiting-approval login keeps its own prominent callout
   (.mem-prefetch-chip.mp-login-hint, defined below) and is NOT part of
   this strip. */
.turn-prov{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;
  margin:0 0 6px 0;padding:2px 2px;
  border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);
  font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.4;color:var(--text-secondary);
  transition:background .15s ease,border-color .15s ease;
}
.turn-prov.tp-expandable{cursor:pointer;user-select:none}
.turn-prov.tp-expandable:hover{
  background:rgba(148,163,184,0.06);
  border-color:rgba(148,163,184,0.16);
}
/* Whole-strip state cue: a quiet 2px left accent bar. Amber gently
   pulses while a segment is still in-flight; green/red hairline once
   the turn's provenance has settled. The base border is transparent and
   already reserves the box, so toggling the left color causes no
   layout shift. Hover background (above) is intentionally left intact. */
.turn-prov.tp-running,
.turn-prov.tp-done,
.turn-prov.tp-has-failed{border-left-width:2px}
.turn-prov.tp-running{border-left-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.7);animation:tp-strip-pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite}
.turn-prov.tp-done{border-left-color:rgba(52,211,153,0.55)}
.turn-prov.tp-has-failed{border-left-color:rgba(248,113,113,0.65)}
@keyframes tp-strip-pulse{0%,100%{border-left-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.7)}50%{border-left-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.25)}}
[data-theme="light"] .turn-prov.tp-running{border-left-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.8)}
[data-theme="light"] .turn-prov.tp-done{border-left-color:rgba(5,150,105,0.55)}
[data-theme="light"] .turn-prov.tp-has-failed{border-left-color:rgba(220,38,38,0.6)}
[data-theme="tofu"] .turn-prov.tp-running{border-left-color:rgba(196,149,106,0.8)}
[data-theme="tofu"] .turn-prov.tp-done{border-left-color:rgba(94,138,80,0.6)}
[data-theme="tofu"] .turn-prov.tp-has-failed{border-left-color:rgba(168,90,74,0.65)}
[data-theme="tofu"] .turn-prov.tp-running{animation:tp-strip-pulse-tofu 2s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes tp-strip-pulse-tofu{0%,100%{border-left-color:rgba(196,149,106,0.8)}50%{border-left-color:rgba(196,149,106,0.3)}}
/* Collapsed icon segments */
.turn-prov .tp-segs{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex:1;min-width:0}
.turn-prov .tp-seg{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;
  color:var(--text-tertiary,rgba(148,163,184,0.7));
}
/* Short text annotation beside each collapsed icon — turns the strip from a
   row of bare glyphs into a quiet, readable label row (e.g. "3 memories ·
   preferences · 2 related chats"). UI sans-serif (NOT mono — mono is reserved
   for metric numbers/counts), tertiary tone so it stays subordinate. */
.turn-prov .tp-seg .tp-label{
  font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-0.01em;
  white-space:nowrap;
}
/* A subtle dot separator between segments so the labels don't run together. */
.turn-prov .tp-segs .tp-seg + .tp-seg::before{
  content:"·";margin-right:7px;color:var(--text-tertiary,rgba(148,163,184,0.4));
  font-weight:600;
}
.turn-prov .tp-seg.tp-done{color:rgba(52,211,153,0.85)}
.turn-prov .tp-seg.tp-running{color:#f59e0b}
.turn-prov .tp-seg .mp-dots{margin-left:1px}
/* Chevron (SVG) */
.turn-prov .tp-chevron{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;flex-shrink:0;
  color:var(--text-tertiary,rgba(148,163,184,0.55));
  transition:transform .2s ease;
}
.turn-prov.tp-expanded .tp-chevron{transform:rotate(180deg)}
/* Expanded detail rows */
.turn-prov .tp-details{display:none;flex-basis:100%;margin-top:6px}
.turn-prov.tp-expanded .tp-details{display:block}
.turn-prov .tp-detail-row{
  display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;
  padding:7px 10px;margin-top:6px;
  border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.16);border-radius:6px;
  background:rgba(148,163,184,0.04);
}
.turn-prov .tp-detail-row:first-child{margin-top:0}
/* Detail rows no longer carry a leading icon (it duplicated the collapsed
   segment's glyph, which stays visible when the strip is expanded). The
   per-segment status colour now rides a 2px left accent bar on the row so the
   expanded detail keeps its visual cue without the redundant glyph. */
.turn-prov .tp-detail-row{border-left-width:2px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgba(148,163,184,0.3)}
.turn-prov .tp-detail-row .mp-text{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0;gap:2px;flex:1}
.turn-prov .tp-detail-row .mp-headline{
  font-weight:600;color:var(--text-primary,#e4e4e7);font-size:12px;
}
.turn-prov .tp-detail-row .mp-sub{
  font-size:10.5px;opacity:0.7;
  font-family:'JetBrains Mono','SF Mono',Menlo,monospace;
}
/* Status accents on the expanded detail rows (left accent bar). */
.turn-prov .tp-detail-row.mp-done{border-left-color:#34d399}
.turn-prov .tp-detail-row.mp-running{border-left-color:#f59e0b}
.turn-prov .tp-detail-prefs{border-left-color:rgba(45,212,191,0.85)}
/* Learned/updated-preferences segment — shares the teal preference accent so
   it reads as a sibling of the "preferences applied" segment. Auto-applied
   consolidation facts are informational (same status as a written memory), so
   they live in the quiet strip rather than a prominent box. */
.turn-prov .tp-seg.tp-seg-prefs-learned{color:rgba(45,212,191,0.85)}
.turn-prov .tp-detail-prefs-learned{border-left-color:rgba(45,212,191,0.85)}
.turn-prov .tp-detail-prefs-learned .pl-seg-lead{
  font-weight:600;color:var(--text-primary,#e4e4e7);margin-right:2px;
}
.turn-prov .pl-seg-undo{margin-left:8px;padding:2px 7px;border:1px solid currentColor;border-radius:5px;background:transparent;color:var(--accent,#818cf8);font:inherit;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;opacity:.85}.turn-prov .pl-seg-undo:hover{opacity:1;background:rgba(99,102,241,.09)}.turn-prov .pl-seg-undo:disabled{cursor:default;opacity:.6}.turn-prov .pl-seg-undo.is-undone{border-color:transparent;color:var(--text-tertiary,#71717a)}
[data-theme="tofu"] .turn-prov .tp-seg.tp-seg-prefs-learned{color:#5E8A50}
[data-theme="tofu"] .turn-prov .tp-detail-prefs-learned{border-left-color:#5E8A50}
[data-theme="tofu"] .turn-prov .tp-detail-prefs-learned .pl-seg-lead{color:#4A3F2F}
[data-theme="light"] .turn-prov .tp-detail-prefs-learned .pl-seg-lead{color:#1f2937}
.turn-prov .tp-detail-login.mp-done{border-left-color:#34d399}
/* Related-conversations segment — a calm indigo so it reads as a sibling of
   the memory (amber) / prefs (teal) segments but stays distinct. */
.turn-prov .tp-seg.tp-seg-convs{color:rgba(129,140,248,0.9)}
.turn-prov .tp-detail-convs{border-left-color:rgba(129,140,248,0.9)}
.turn-prov .rc-list{margin:6px 0 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px}
.turn-prov .rc-list li{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.35}
.turn-prov .rc-conv-link{
  color:var(--accent,#818cf8);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;
}
.turn-prov .rc-conv-link:hover{text-decoration:underline}
.turn-prov .rc-conv-title{font-weight:600;color:var(--text-primary,#e4e4e7)}
.turn-prov .rc-conv-summary{
  font-size:10.5px;opacity:0.72;margin-top:1px;color:var(--text-secondary);
  white-space:normal;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;line-height:1.45;
}
/* Related-conv titles must WRAP fully, never clip with an ellipsis — a long
   CJK title is the user's only handle on which sibling this is. */
.turn-prov .rc-conv-link,
.turn-prov .rc-conv-title{
  white-space:normal;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;
}

/* ── Memory + preference detail lists inside the provenance strip ──────
   The .mp-mem-list / .mp-mem-name / .mp-mem-desc / .pa-list rules above are
   scoped to .mem-prefetch-chip, which is NOT an ancestor of the expanded
   turn-prov detail rows. Without these the lists fell back to the default
   UA <ul> (disc bullets, 40px indent, inherited serif) — the "字体不好看"
   complaint. Re-scope a clean, readable variant under .turn-prov and let the
   full text WRAP so memory descriptions are no longer clipped on expand. */
.turn-prov .mp-mem-list{
  list-style:none;margin:6px 0 0 0;padding:0;
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;
  font-family:inherit;
}
.turn-prov .mp-mem-list li{
  padding:6px 9px;border-radius:6px;
  background:rgba(148,163,184,0.05);
  border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.16);
  font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.5;
  overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;
}
.turn-prov .mp-mem-name{font-weight:600;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-primary,#e4e4e7)}
.turn-prov .mp-mem-scope{
  font-size:9px;padding:1px 6px;margin-left:6px;border-radius:10px;
  background:rgba(148,163,184,0.16);color:var(--text-secondary);
  text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em;font-weight:700;vertical-align:1px;
}
.turn-prov .mp-mem-desc{
  margin-top:3px;color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;
  font-family:inherit;white-space:normal;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;
}
/* Inline code/emphasis rendered by _tpInlineMd — keep them quiet, never
   inherit a code-block background that would dwarf a one-line bullet. */
.turn-prov .mp-mem-list code,
.turn-prov .rc-conv-summary code{
  font-family:'JetBrains Mono','SF Mono',Menlo,monospace;font-size:10.5px;
  padding:0 4px;border-radius:4px;background:rgba(148,163,184,0.14);
  overflow-wrap:anywhere;
}
.turn-prov .mp-mem-list.pa-list li{
  background:rgba(45,212,191,0.06);border-color:rgba(45,212,191,0.22);
  color:var(--text-primary,#e4e4e7);
}
[data-theme="light"] .turn-prov .mp-mem-list li{background:rgba(100,116,139,0.06);border-color:rgba(100,116,139,0.18)}
[data-theme="light"] .turn-prov .mp-mem-name{color:#1f2937}
[data-theme="light"] .turn-prov .mp-mem-desc{color:#374151}
[data-theme="light"] .turn-prov .mp-mem-list.pa-list li{background:rgba(45,212,191,0.08);border-color:rgba(45,212,191,0.3)}
[data-theme="tofu"] .turn-prov .mp-mem-list li{background:#F8F6F0;border-color:#C4B89E}
[data-theme="tofu"] .turn-prov .mp-mem-name{color:#4A3F2F}
[data-theme="tofu"] .turn-prov .mp-mem-desc{color:#5A4F3F}
[data-theme="tofu"] .turn-prov .mp-mem-list.pa-list li{background:rgba(94,138,80,0.08);border-color:rgba(94,138,80,0.3)}
[data-theme="tofu"] .turn-prov .tp-seg.tp-seg-convs{color:#7C6FA8}
[data-theme="tofu"] .turn-prov .tp-detail-convs{border-left-color:#7C6FA8}
[data-theme="light"] .turn-prov .tp-detail-row .mp-headline{color:#1f2937}
[data-theme="light"] .turn-prov .tp-detail-row{background:rgba(100,116,139,0.05);border-color:rgba(100,116,139,0.16)}
[data-theme="light"] .turn-prov.tp-expandable:hover{background:rgba(100,116,139,0.07);border-color:rgba(100,116,139,0.2)}
[data-theme="tofu"] .turn-prov .tp-detail-row{background:rgba(196,149,106,0.06);border-color:rgba(196,149,106,0.22)}
[data-theme="tofu"] .turn-prov .tp-detail-row .mp-headline{color:#4A3F2F}
[data-theme="tofu"] .turn-prov .tp-detail-row .mp-sub{color:#736750}
[data-theme="tofu"] .turn-prov.tp-expandable:hover{background:rgba(196,149,106,0.1);border-color:rgba(196,149,106,0.3)}
[data-theme="tofu"] .turn-prov .tp-seg.tp-done{color:#5E8A50}
[data-theme="tofu"] .turn-prov .tp-seg.tp-running{color:#C4956A}
[data-theme="tofu"] .turn-prov .tp-detail-prefs{border-left-color:#5E8A50}

.mem-prefetch-chip{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
  padding:7px 11px;margin:0 0 8px 0;
  background:rgba(234,179,8,0.04);
  border:1px solid rgba(234,179,8,0.22);
  border-radius:var(--radius-sm);
  font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.4;color:var(--text-secondary);
  font-family:'JetBrains Mono','SF Mono',Menlo,monospace;
  max-width:100%;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  transition:background .15s ease,border-color .15s ease;
}

/* Preferences-applied chip — same shape as the prefetch chip but a calmer
   teal accent so the two read as siblings yet stay distinguishable. The
   "preferences applied" chip is intentionally quiet (collapsed by default). */
.mem-prefetch-chip.pa-chip{
  background:rgba(45,212,191,0.05);
  border-color:rgba(45,212,191,0.22);
}
.mem-prefetch-chip.pa-chip .mp-icon{color:rgba(45,212,191,0.8)}
.mem-prefetch-chip.pa-chip .mp-mem-list.pa-list li{
  background:rgba(45,212,191,0.06);
  border-color:rgba(45,212,191,0.22);
  color:var(--text-primary,#e4e4e7);
}

/* Icon + text column */
.mem-prefetch-chip .mp-icon{
  flex-shrink:0;width:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-size:13px;color:rgba(234,179,8,0.75);line-height:1;
}
.mem-prefetch-chip .mp-text{
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0;gap:2px;flex:1;
}
.mem-prefetch-chip .mp-headline{
  font-weight:600;color:var(--text-primary,#e4e4e7);font-size:11.5px;
  /* Default: single line with ellipsis. Variants that need full wrapping
     (login-hint body copy, expandable memory details) override below. */
  white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;
}
.mem-prefetch-chip .mp-sub{
  font-size:10.5px;opacity:0.7;
  white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;
}

/* Three-dot "working" indicator — amber dots, not indigo */
.mem-prefetch-chip .mp-dots{display:inline-flex;gap:3px;align-items:center;margin-left:2px;flex-shrink:0}
.mem-prefetch-chip .mp-dots span{
  width:3px;height:3px;border-radius:50%;
  background:rgba(245,158,11,0.85);
  animation:mp-dot-pulse 1.2s infinite ease-in-out;
}
.mem-prefetch-chip .mp-dots span:nth-child(2){animation-delay:0.15s}
.mem-prefetch-chip .mp-dots span:nth-child(3){animation-delay:0.3s}
@keyframes mp-dot-pulse{0%,60%,100%{opacity:0.25;transform:scale(0.8)}30%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1)}}

/* Chevron for expandable prefetch chip */

/* Expanded details area (memory list) */
.mem-prefetch-chip .mp-mem-list{
  list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;
}
.mem-prefetch-chip .mp-mem-list li{
  padding:7px 9px;
  background:rgba(234,179,8,0.06);
  border:1px solid rgba(234,179,8,0.22);
  border-radius:6px;
  font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.5;
}
.mem-prefetch-chip .mp-mem-name{font-weight:600;color:#fbbf24;font-size:12px}
.mem-prefetch-chip .mp-mem-scope{
  font-size:9px;padding:1px 6px;margin-left:6px;border-radius:10px;
  background:rgba(234,179,8,0.16);color:#fde68a;
  text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em;font-weight:700;
  vertical-align:1px;
}
.mem-prefetch-chip .mp-mem-desc{
  margin-top:4px;color:var(--text-primary,#e4e4e7);font-size:11px;
  opacity:0.85;font-family:inherit;white-space:normal;line-height:1.5;
}

/* ── Status variants ─────────────────────────────────────────────
   Amber = running (default), green = done, red = failed, slate = skipped.
   Same semantic palette as the tool panel's ptool-badge-ok / -err / -warn. */
.mem-prefetch-chip.mp-running{
  border-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.32);background:rgba(245,158,11,0.05);
}
.mem-prefetch-chip.mp-running .mp-icon{color:#f59e0b}
.mem-prefetch-chip.mp-done{
  border-color:rgba(52,211,153,0.3);background:rgba(52,211,153,0.05);
}
.mem-prefetch-chip.mp-done .mp-icon{color:#34d399}
.mem-prefetch-chip.mp-done .mp-mem-name{color:#86efac}

/* ── MCP login-hint sub-variant ──────────────────────────────────
   Same chassis as mem-prefetch-chip but needs to accommodate:
     • a wrapping multi-line headline (full question, no ellipsis)
     • a free-text subtitle that wraps
     • an optional pretty-printed JSON snippet block
     • a gentle glow while awaiting approval so the user notices
   The glow is limited to the "awaiting_approval" state — approved
   and failed variants are quiet like everything else in the panel. */
.mem-prefetch-chip.mp-login-hint{
  align-items:flex-start;        /* icon aligns with first line of headline */
}
.mem-prefetch-chip.mp-login-hint .mp-icon{margin-top:1px}
.mem-prefetch-chip.mp-login-hint .mp-headline,
.mem-prefetch-chip.mp-login-hint .mp-sub{
  white-space:normal;overflow:visible;text-overflow:clip;
  word-break:break-word;line-height:1.5;
}
.mem-prefetch-chip.mp-login-hint .mp-sub{opacity:0.78;margin-top:1px}
.mem-prefetch-chip.mp-login-hint pre.mp-snippet{
  margin:6px 0 0;padding:8px 10px;
  background:rgba(0,0,0,0.22);
  border:1px solid rgba(234,179,8,0.14);
  border-radius:6px;
  font-family:'JetBrains Mono','SF Mono',Menlo,monospace;
  font-size:10.5px;line-height:1.45;
  white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-word;
  max-height:260px;overflow:auto;
  color:var(--text-secondary);
  flex-basis:100%;
}
/* Running state: soft amber breathing outline, no heavy pulse */
.mem-prefetch-chip.mp-login-hint.mp-running{
  animation:mp-login-breathe 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;
}
@keyframes mp-login-breathe{
  0%,100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(245,158,11,0.24)}
  50%    {box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(245,158,11,0)}
}

/* ── Light theme overrides ──────────────────────────────────────── */
[data-theme="light"] .mem-prefetch-chip{
  background:rgba(180,140,0,0.05);border-color:rgba(180,140,0,0.28);
}
[data-theme="light"] .mem-prefetch-chip .mp-icon{color:#a06e00}
[data-theme="light"] .mem-prefetch-chip .mp-headline{color:#1f2937}
[data-theme="light"] .mem-prefetch-chip .mp-sub{color:#4b5563;opacity:0.9}
[data-theme="light"] .mem-prefetch-chip.mp-running{
  background:rgba(245,158,11,0.06);border-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.35);
}
[data-theme="light"] .mem-prefetch-chip.mp-done{
  background:rgba(34,197,94,0.06);border-color:rgba(34,197,94,0.32);
}
[data-theme="light"] .mem-prefetch-chip.mp-done .mp-icon{color:#059669}
[data-theme="light"] .mem-prefetch-chip .mp-mem-list li{
  background:rgba(245,158,11,0.08);border-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.28);
}
[data-theme="light"] .mem-prefetch-chip .mp-mem-name{color:#b45309}
[data-theme="light"] .mem-prefetch-chip.mp-done .mp-mem-name{color:#047857}
[data-theme="light"] .mem-prefetch-chip .mp-mem-scope{
  background:rgba(245,158,11,0.18);color:#92400e;
}
[data-theme="light"] .mem-prefetch-chip .mp-mem-desc{color:#1f2937;opacity:1}
[data-theme="light"] .mem-prefetch-chip.mp-login-hint pre.mp-snippet{
  background:rgba(0,0,0,0.04);border-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.08);color:#374151;
}

/* ── Tofu theme overrides — warm ivory/kinako/matcha/azuki ──────
   The default chip uses neon amber (#eab308) + lime (#86efac) +
   mint (#34d399) which fight the soy-milk palette and make the
   text-on-tint unreadable. Rebuild with the tofu token palette,
   matching the adjacent .ptool-panel pixel-window aesthetic:
     • kinako warm #C4956A / #A67B52 for running / info
     • matcha #5E8A50 / #6A8A5E for done
     • azuki #A85A4A / #B46E60 for failed
     • muted #9C9178 for skipped
   Use flat 1px borders (no NES 3D) since this chip sits ABOVE
   the ptool-panel and should read as a subtle prelude banner. */
[data-theme="tofu"] .mem-prefetch-chip{
  background:rgba(196,149,106,0.06);
  border:1px solid rgba(196,149,106,0.28);
  border-radius:var(--radius-sm);
  color:#4A3F2F;
  font-family:var(--sans-body);
}
[data-theme="tofu"] .mem-prefetch-chip .mp-icon{color:#A67B52}
[data-theme="tofu"] .mem-prefetch-chip .mp-headline{color:#4A3F2F}
[data-theme="tofu"] .mem-prefetch-chip .mp-sub{color:#736750;opacity:1}
[data-theme="tofu"] .mem-prefetch-chip .mp-dots span{background:#C4956A}

/* ── Status variants ── */
[data-theme="tofu"] .mem-prefetch-chip.mp-running{
  background:rgba(196,149,106,0.08);border-color:rgba(196,149,106,0.35);
}
[data-theme="tofu"] .mem-prefetch-chip.mp-running .mp-icon{color:#C4956A}
[data-theme="tofu"] .mem-prefetch-chip.mp-done{
  background:rgba(106,138,94,0.07);border-color:rgba(106,138,94,0.32);
}
[data-theme="tofu"] .mem-prefetch-chip.mp-done .mp-icon{color:#5E8A50}

/* ── Memory list items (expanded details) ── */
[data-theme="tofu"] .mem-prefetch-chip .mp-mem-list li{
  background:#F8F6F0;
  border:1.5px solid #C4B89E;
  border-top-color:#DDD6C4;border-left-color:#DDD6C4;
  border-right-color:#A89878;border-bottom-color:#A89878;
  border-radius:6px;
  box-shadow:0 1px 0 #C8BDA6;
  color:#4A3F2F;
}
[data-theme="tofu"] .mem-prefetch-chip .mp-mem-name{
  color:#7A5A3A;            /* dark kinako — readable on ivory */
  font-weight:700;
}
[data-theme="tofu"] .mem-prefetch-chip.mp-done .mp-mem-name{
  color:#4E7242;            /* dark matcha */
}
[data-theme="tofu"] .mem-prefetch-chip .mp-mem-scope{
  background:rgba(196,149,106,0.18);
  color:#7A5A3A;
  border:1px solid rgba(196,149,106,0.35);
  border-radius:4px;
